					Hits apply "Crystalline Opal Mark" for 5 seconds.

					"Crystalline Opal Mark": When a minion or sentry attacks the marked target, consumes the mark and releases a Crystalline Opal Bolt dealing 115% of the weapon damage when the mark was applied. On hit, it splits into 4 crystals, each dealing 35% of the Crystalline Opal Bolt's damage, plus 2 Crystalline Shards.
