					Hits apply "Crystalline Aquamarine Mark" for 5 seconds.

					"Crystalline Aquamarine Mark": When a minion or sentry attacks the marked target, consumes the mark and releases a Crystalline Aquamarine Bolt dealing 130% of the weapon damage when the mark was applied. It can pierce 5 enemies; damage is reduced by 15% after each hit, plus 2 Crystalline Shards.
