			LegendaryContract: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Nine colors become legendary, resonating with the power of all things.

					While equipped: whip range increased by 10%, maximum minions increased by 1, and maximum sentries increased by 1.
					Converts the held magic weapon into a summon weapon with 65% base damage.
					Hits apply 「Legendary Sigil」 for 5 seconds.

					「Legendary Sigil」: When a minion or sentry attacks the marked target, consumes the mark, deals 80% of the weapon damage when the mark was applied, and inflicts 「Legendary Resonance」 for 6 seconds.

					「Legendary Resonance」: Summon attacks gain 20% marked critical strike chance, plus marked critical strike chance equal to 25% of your magic critical strike chance. Marked critical hits drop Rainbow Enhancements.

					Picking up a Rainbow Enhancement grants a random Resonance stack and restores a small amount of life, mana, and inspiration. Up to 9 stacks; each lasts 8 seconds.
					'''
				DisplayName: Legendary Contract
			}

